# PERM-EARLY probe (fx only): in ask, a write_file deny remembered AFTER the
# first prompt, then the model calls exactly that write. fx v0.0.16 asks about
# it anyway: its remembered write_file rule does not decide the call it names.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
gateway p5-permissions-early-probe-turn.json
wait 2
type /permissions ask
key Enter
wait 1
type first
key Enter
wait 3
type /permissions remember deny write_file {"path":"b.txt","content":"y"}
key Enter
wait 1.5
key Enter
wait 1
type write it
key Enter
wait 3
snap after-call
home end
gwlog
